{
  "_id": "hover-fixture",
  "_comment": "\"is hovered\" conditionals lowered to the browser's hover (WTF-590): a Text's own hover sets its color (bCardTitle), a group's hover shows a hidden group inside it with its contents (bCard, bCardTools), a Text's hover paints a sibling (bCardDot, a rule within bCard), a child's hover paints the group holding it (bRowIcon, bRow), and a zero-size hover group shows a Text inside it (bZero, bZeroShown). An \"is hovered\" combined with another condition stays a conditional the page does not keep (bComboVis), and so does a hover that hides an element before a later state that sets its visibility (bOrder). Another element's \"is visible\" of an element a hover shows is not decided on the server (bToolsEcho). All data invented. test/support/target/phoenix/hover_behavior.exs, scripts/hover_browser_check.sh",
